* group[+]
  * source = "https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core-clinical/StructureDefinition/be-model-episode-of-care"
  * target = "https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core-clinical/StructureDefinition/be-episode-of-care"
  * insert ConceptMapElement(identifier, Unique Business Identifier of the CareSet, EpisodeOfCare.identifier, Business Identifier(s\) relevant for this EpisodeOfCare, equivalent, 1..* MS)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(patient, The person who is the subject of the healthcare to which the record refers, EpisodeOfCare.patient, The patient who is the focus of this episode of care, equivalent, only Reference(BePatient\))
  * insert ConceptMapElement(recordedDate, Recording date by the Author or Recorder (date of last update\), EpisodeOfCare.extension:recordedDate, BeExtRecordedDate (be-core\), equivalent, R4 EpisodeOfCare has no recorded date; carried by the be-core extension be-ext-recorded-date (context DomainResource\)\, constrained to 1..1.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(creationDate, Date of first registration, EpisodeOfCare.extension:creationDate, BeExtCreationDate (be-core\), equivalent, R4 EpisodeOfCare has no creation date\, and it cannot share be-ext-recorded-date: two occurrences of the same extension would be indistinguishable\, while RecordedDate is the last update and Creation date the first registration. Carried by the be-core extension be-ext-creation-date (context DomainResource\)\, constrained to 1..1.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(status, Current status of the episode, EpisodeOfCare.status, planned | waitlist | active | onhold | finished | cancelled | entered-in-error, wider, R4 required binding on EpisodeOfCare.status is kept. VS_Status_EpisodeOfCare in the CareSet lists only active\, onhold\, finished and entered-in-error\, while the business rules also refer to Cancelled - the R4 value set is wider.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(author, The healthcare professional who takes responsibility for the recorded content, EpisodeOfCare.extension:author, BeExtRecorder (be-core\), equivalent, R4 EpisodeOfCare has no author/recorder element; carried by the be-core extension be-ext-recorder.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(period, The period between the moment the resource is created to group the provided care and the moment it ends, EpisodeOfCare.period, Interval during responsibility is assumed, equivalent, Constrained to 1..1 per CareSet V0.8. Business rules: period.start is required when status is active; period.end is required when status is finished or cancelled - not expressed as an invariant yet.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(reason, The problem treated during the EpisodeOfCare, EpisodeOfCare.diagnosis.condition, The list of diagnosis relevant to this episode of care, equivalent, R4 EpisodeOfCare has no reason element; the problem is carried by diagnosis.condition\, constrained to 1..1 Reference(BeProblem\) per CareSet V0.8.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(reason, The problem treated during the EpisodeOfCare - coded form, EpisodeOfCare.diagnosis.condition.extension:code, BeExtCodeableConcept (be-core\), equivalent, be-ext-codeableconcept has context Element\, so it can codify the reference itself: the problem can be sent as a code (VS_Encounter_Reason - the business case uses SNOMED 44054006\) when no BeProblem resource is referenced.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(note, Optional additional remark, EpisodeOfCare.extension:note, BeExtSimpleNote (be-core\), equivalent, R4 EpisodeOfCare has no note element; carried by the be-core extension be-ext-simple-note.)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(managingOrganization, Organization responsible for the management and coordination of the patient's EpisodeOfCare, EpisodeOfCare.managingOrganization, Organization that assumes care, narrower, CareSet says 0..*; R4 EpisodeOfCare.managingOrganization is 0..1 and cannot be repeated. Constrained to Reference(BeOrganization\).)
  * insert ConceptMapElement(careTeam, CareTeam involved in the care carried out within this EpisodeOfCare, EpisodeOfCare.team, Other practitioners facilitating this episode of care, equivalent, New in CareSet V0.8. Targets the base CareTeam resource - there is no BeCareTeam in be-core (one exists in patient-dossier\).)
